WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:31.666
In the verse 14.26,

2
00:00:31.666 --> 00:00:32.333
Lord Krishna

3
00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:34.875
answers Arjun’s question –

4
00:00:34.875 --> 00:00:37.708
how can a seeker rise above the
three gunas of prakriti – 

5
00:00:37.708 --> 00:00:41.625
sattva, rajas, and tamas?

6
00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:42.583
In the previous verses

7
00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:46.541
He described the signs and conduct of
such a seeker.

8
00:00:46.541 --> 00:00:48.041
Now He reveals

9
00:00:48.041 --> 00:00:50.375
the means by which a person

10
00:00:50.375 --> 00:00:53.416
can truly rise above the gunas.

11
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:00.666
Lord Krishna explains here that

12
00:01:00.666 --> 00:01:02.083
the person who serves Him

13
00:01:02.083 --> 00:01:04.666
with unwavering devotion

14
00:01:04.666 --> 00:01:09.125
rises above the gunas –
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

15
00:01:09.125 --> 00:01:11.791
and attains the state of Brahman.

16
00:01:11.791 --> 00:01:14.541
Such devotion is not half-hearted.

17
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:18.166
It is not a practice dependent on the
mood of the mind,

18
00:01:18.166 --> 00:01:21.375
nor something done only occasionally.

19
00:01:21.375 --> 00:01:24.416
Avyabhicharena means – continuous

20
00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:26.333
and unwavering devotion.

21
00:01:26.333 --> 00:01:28.041
Such a devotee does not get caught

22
00:01:28.041 --> 00:01:30.166
in attractions and distractions.

23
00:01:30.166 --> 00:01:32.875
Even a seeker on the path of knowledge

24
00:01:32.875 --> 00:01:35.750
ultimately takes shelter in devotion.

25
00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:38.875
Knowledge can take one up to
the desire for liberation,

26
00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:42.541
but to truly cross beyond
sattva, rajas, and tamas,

27
00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:44.375
they too must embrace sincere

28
00:01:44.375 --> 00:01:46.791
devotion to Lord Krishna.

29
00:01:46.791 --> 00:01:50.000
We are not always perfect in devotion.

30
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:51.583
Sometimes the mind wanders

31
00:01:51.583 --> 00:01:52.875
and gets caught

32
00:01:52.875 --> 00:01:55.541
in the gunas.

33
00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:58.458
But Lord Krishna assures us –

34
00:01:58.458 --> 00:01:59.833
begin from

35
00:01:59.833 --> 00:02:04.541
where you are and keep going steadily.

36
00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:06.041
Even a small sincerity,

37
00:02:06.041 --> 00:02:08.083
if practised regularly,

38
00:02:08.083 --> 00:02:10.708
creates a very deep impact.

39
00:02:10.708 --> 00:02:12.333
Just as a weak hand

40
00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:15.125
grows strong through constant practice,

41
00:02:15.125 --> 00:02:18.125
in the same way regular spiritual practice

42
00:02:18.125 --> 00:02:21.250
makes devotion pure and powerful.

43
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:22.958
Devotion is the direct path –

44
00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:27.041
it is not merely the means, but the goal itself.

45
00:02:27.041 --> 00:02:28.458
When we serve Lord Krishna

46
00:02:28.458 --> 00:02:30.666
with love,

47
00:02:30.666 --> 00:02:32.916
we are not only liberated –

48
00:02:32.916 --> 00:02:36.333
we also experience fullness.

49
00:02:41.416 --> 00:02:42.375
Does this

50
00:02:42.375 --> 00:02:45.083
ever come to your mind –

51
00:02:45.083 --> 00:02:49.416
‘Am I truly able to practise devotion?

52
00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:52.916
Is my restless mind and entangled

53
00:02:52.916 --> 00:02:56.583
life taking me far from this path?’

54
00:02:56.583 --> 00:02:59.875
But I want to assure you –

55
00:02:59.875 --> 00:03:03.875
devotion does not need perfection,

56
00:03:03.875 --> 00:03:05.625
it needs sincerity.

57
00:03:05.625 --> 00:03:07.291
If you give Me

58
00:03:07.291 --> 00:03:10.750
a little time each day,

59
00:03:10.750 --> 00:03:14.916
offer a few sincere words,

60
00:03:14.916 --> 00:03:21.083
or remember Me with a calm mind –

61
00:03:21.083 --> 00:03:24.125
that is enough.

62
00:03:24.125 --> 00:03:26.958
I do not expect

63
00:03:26.958 --> 00:03:29.708
you to never make a mistake.

64
00:03:29.708 --> 00:03:34.625
I expect only that you keep making the effort,

65
00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:36.708
and that you do not give up.

66
00:03:36.708 --> 00:03:39.041
Just as a continuous stream of water

67
00:03:39.041 --> 00:03:41.833
leaves its mark even on stone,

68
00:03:41.833 --> 00:03:44.625
in the same way regular devotion

69
00:03:44.625 --> 00:03:47.583
gradually purifies the heart.

70
00:03:47.583 --> 00:03:53.458
Results may not be visible at first, but

71
00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:56.625
a deep transformation begins within.

72
00:03:56.625 --> 00:04:00.708
Sattva, rajas, and tamas – these gunas give birth

73
00:04:00.708 --> 00:04:02.583
to your old habits, emotions,

74
00:04:02.583 --> 00:04:05.416
and distractions.

75
00:04:05.416 --> 00:04:09.875
But when you make even a small
offering each day,

76
00:04:09.875 --> 00:04:14.708
these gunas begin to loosen their grip.

77
00:04:14.708 --> 00:04:17.125
Every small offering brings you

78
00:04:17.125 --> 00:04:19.416
closer to Me.

79
00:04:19.416 --> 00:04:24.916
Never underestimate the steady
power of devotion.

80
00:04:24.916 --> 00:04:25.666
Even a little

81
00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:29.458
remembrance, done every day,

82
00:04:29.458 --> 00:04:33.083
will carry you from confusion

83
00:04:33.083 --> 00:04:36.083
to peace.

84
00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:37.583
Reflect on this.

85
00:04:42.375 --> 00:04:45.500
You must have experienced this –

86
00:04:45.500 --> 00:04:48.875
in family life, emotions often

87
00:04:48.875 --> 00:04:51.625
keep going up and down.

88
00:04:51.625 --> 00:04:54.416
Sometimes disagreements come,

89
00:04:54.416 --> 00:04:58.125
sometimes moments of anger, and sometimes

90
00:04:58.125 --> 00:05:02.083
silence feels heavier than words.

91
00:05:02.083 --> 00:05:05.250
Sattva, rajas, and tamas

92
00:05:05.250 --> 00:05:08.416
keep shifting.

93
00:05:08.416 --> 00:05:10.750
And along with them,

94
00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:13.750
your moods and reactions

95
00:05:13.750 --> 00:05:15.333
shift too.

96
00:05:15.333 --> 00:05:21.083
But beneath all of this is a deeper power –

97
00:05:21.083 --> 00:05:22.625
tell Me.

98
00:05:22.625 --> 00:05:24.708
Come, take a guess.

99
00:05:24.708 --> 00:05:26.375
Yes –

100
00:05:26.375 --> 00:05:28.083
devotion.

101
00:05:28.083 --> 00:05:33.125
Your sincere devotion toward Me.

102
00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:37.750
If even one member of the family

103
00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.083
sincerely turns toward Me,

104
00:05:40.083 --> 00:05:43.500
a wave of peace rises from them

105
00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.625
that touches everyone’s heart.

106
00:05:46.625 --> 00:05:52.250
When devotion becomes the family’s
shared practice –

107
00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:56.291
whether singing together, reading scripture,

108
00:05:56.291 --> 00:06:00.041
or simply remembering Me –

109
00:06:00.041 --> 00:06:03.083
a sacred bond forms

110
00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:06.916
that no guna can shake.

111
00:06:06.916 --> 00:06:11.583
Ego can separate you, but devotion

112
00:06:11.583 --> 00:06:14.416
brings you back together.

113
00:06:14.416 --> 00:06:15.625
You do not need

114
00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:19.500
to fix every situation yourself.

115
00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:22.083
Simply make a place

116
00:06:22.083 --> 00:06:25.416
for Me in your home –

117
00:06:25.416 --> 00:06:30.791
and then I will mend what is broken.

118
00:06:30.791 --> 00:06:31.958
Let devotion become

119
00:06:31.958 --> 00:06:35.083
that quiet strength

120
00:06:35.083 --> 00:06:38.416
which binds your hearts together –

121
00:06:38.416 --> 00:06:42.666
beyond arguments and expectations.

122
00:06:42.666 --> 00:06:44.208
Reflect on this.

123
00:06:49.250 --> 00:06:53.333
If you wish to be a true leader,

124
00:06:53.333 --> 00:06:56.583
remember – leadership is not about

125
00:06:56.583 --> 00:07:00.291
getting lost in many tasks, but

126
00:07:00.291 --> 00:07:06.125
about being fully present in every moment.

127
00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:09.000
Just as unwavering devotion

128
00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.125
lifts you above the gunas,

129
00:07:12.125 --> 00:07:14.500
in the same way focused sincerity

130
00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:18.000
makes you exceptional in your work.

131
00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:22.041
When your mind keeps jumping –

132
00:07:22.041 --> 00:07:26.083
from one message to a meeting,
from work to stress –

133
00:07:26.083 --> 00:07:31.458
how will you bring steadiness to others?

134
00:07:31.458 --> 00:07:36.208
As a leader, your energy

135
00:07:36.208 --> 00:07:40.000
shapes the entire atmosphere.

136
00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:43.041
If you remain unsettled,

137
00:07:43.041 --> 00:07:46.291
your team will be unsettled too.

138
00:07:46.291 --> 00:07:49.333
But when you show up with clarity

139
00:07:49.333 --> 00:07:52.375
and calm, even under pressure –

140
00:07:52.375 --> 00:07:57.708
everyone around you feels safe and trusted.

141
00:07:57.708 --> 00:07:59.833
For an employee too,

142
00:07:59.833 --> 00:08:03.583
keeping mental stability is essential.

143
00:08:03.583 --> 00:08:07.666
Remaining stressed about deadline-driven work

144
00:08:07.666 --> 00:08:10.125
is not a solution.

145
00:08:10.125 --> 00:08:12.708
Trust the leadership,

146
00:08:12.708 --> 00:08:16.083
apply your best ability –

147
00:08:16.083 --> 00:08:19.000
effort done with patience

148
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:21.375
always succeeds.

149
00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:26.500
You do not need to chase every task.

150
00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:31.791
Ground yourself in purpose, in values,

151
00:08:31.791 --> 00:08:34.375
and yes – in Me.

152
00:08:34.375 --> 00:08:36.166
Let your steadiness

153
00:08:36.166 --> 00:08:40.375
become your greatest strength.

154
00:08:40.375 --> 00:08:45.583
Just as devotion purifies the heart,

155
00:08:45.583 --> 00:08:49.250
your focused sincerity

156
00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:54.083
elevates the entire work environment.

157
00:08:54.083 --> 00:08:59.500
The more steadily you work from within,

158
00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:01.416
the more people

159
00:09:01.416 --> 00:09:04.041
will move forward with you.
